<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo prices 500 mln DEM to Jan 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo prices 500 mln DEM to Jan 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced by joint lead managers Dresdner Kleinwort Benson, Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Bayerische Vereinsbank, Commerzbank and Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHKENBANK FRANKFURT</p>
<p> AMT   *1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.5 PCT   MATURITY    15.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.24     PAY DATE  S-09.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    99.07     SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    8 BP	SELL CONC  17 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BOBL 121</p>
<p> NOTES     *1.0 BLN DEM BOND LAUNCHED ON 30.APR.97 INCREASED BY</p>
<p>		500 MLN DEM</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
